                                    <strong>Ho ten:</strong> Tran Minh Anh
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-2">
                                    <strong>Quan he:</strong> Con gai
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-2">
                                    <strong>Ngay sinh:</strong> 15/08/2020
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-2">
                                    <strong>Gioi tinh:</strong> Nu
